    "Ahora instalemos WINE" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now let's install WINE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ahora, el juego" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now, the game"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Al día" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Up to date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Antes de mover nada, se hace un respaldo completo de tu carpeta del juego (juego + mods tal como están). Después, solo se guardan aparte los archivos de texto sueltos (instrucciones, changelog) en una carpeta \"Documentación y extras\" — las carpetas de mods y los archivos del juego NO se tocan, para no arriesgarse a romper algo." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Before moving anything, a full backup of your game folder is made (game + mods exactly as they are). After that, only loose text files (instructions, changelogs) are tucked away into a \"Documentation and extras\" folder — mod folders and game files are NOT touched, to avoid risking breaking anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apariencia" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Appearance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí va a aparecer lo que pase al instalar, descargar o jugar." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What happens while installing, downloading, or playing will show up here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archivo del juego" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Game file"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automático" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Automatic"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Busca tus partidas guardadas y guarda una copia aparte, por si algo sale mal." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finds your saved games and keeps a separate copy, just in case."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buscando..." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Checking..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buscar actualizaciones" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check for updates"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cada mod va en su propia carpeta dentro de \"Mods\", junto al .exe. Actívalos o desactívalos aquí sin tener que borrarlos — útil, por ejemplo, para confirmar si un problema es del juego base o de algún mod." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each mod goes in its own folder inside \"Mods\", next to the .exe. Turn them on or off here without deleting them — useful, for example, to check whether a problem comes from the base game or from a mod."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calidad" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
