    "Diagnóstico seguro" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Safe diagnostic mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elegir otro .exe..." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose a different .exe..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esto abre la Terminal con el comando ya escrito. Pulsa Enter, escribe tu contraseña de Mac cuando la pida (no se ve mientras escribes, es normal) y espera a que termine. Luego vuelve aquí y pulsa \"Ya lo instalé\"." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This opens Terminal with the command already typed in. Press Enter, type your Mac password when it asks for it (it won't show as you type — that's normal), and wait for it to finish. Then come back here and tap \"I've installed it\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esto borra la resolución, calidad gráfica, controles y otras opciones guardadas del juego. Tus partidas guardadas no se tocan." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This clears the resolution, graphics quality, controls, and other saved game options. Your saved games aren't touched."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esto permite correr el juego de Windows en tu Mac. Puede tardar varios minutos." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This lets you run the Windows game on your Mac. It can take several minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
